    "description": "\uf076 Rampant urbanization reduces dairy feed production near Indian cities. \uf076 Farmers rely on food leftovers and lakeshore vegetation as alternative feed sources. \uf076 Changed diets impacts milk quality, especially the fatty acid profile. \uf076 Urban cows\u2019 milk contains more beneficial fatty acids than peri-urban cows\u2019 milk.",
